/-!
# `PC8` is representation-infinite

Open penny-farthing (`n = 2`): the `Ã₄` cycle `t → x → x ← t → c ← t` along `β`, `α`, `β`, `γ` and `γ ℓ` (`ℓ` a radical endomorphism of `c`).

